  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1772002702_8172495_5c77aaa84c6ea9ec3bd165b1ca2c0185.jpg",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong><br>We specialise in premium luxury hot chocolate made with either real 44% Belgian milk chocolate flakes or 75% Dark Chocolate flakes, for a rich, smooth and indulgent drinking experience. Our chocolate is crafted using high-quality ingredients to deliver a thick, velvety texture and authentic flavour that stands out from standard cocoa powders.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>Unlike instant mixes, our product contains real chocolate flakes, creating a deeper taste and superior melt. It’s perfect for true chocolate lovers who value quality, indulgence and café-style results at home.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Affiliates earn competitive 15% commission on every successful sale generated through their unique tracking link. Your audience receives 10% off using your exclusive code, helping you convert more sales and increase your earnings. With strong product appeal and attractive price points, conversions are high, especially during autumn and winter seasons.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>Promote via social media, recipe content, seasonal gift guides, cosy lifestyle posts, email marketing and hot drink roundups. Perfect for influencers in food, family, gifting and home comfort niches.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Other information:</strong><br>Ideal for gifting, hampers, seasonal promotions and everyday indulgence.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></p></div></div>",
